#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:5 5190721f953f4493b2bff6586a1cd37c
msgid "SIYI RC/HD Video Transmission System"
msgstr "SIYI RC/高清视频传输系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:10 c986a7237873470a9493b08c1a263ae4
msgid ""
"SIYI MK32 is an integrated remote controller, ground station and wireless "
"digital transmission system which can be used with Ardupilot. Up to 15km "
"range transmission of HD Video, control and telemetry is possible, which can"
" be doubled via the use of the SIYI HM30 in repeater mode."
msgstr ""
"SIYI MK32 是集成了遥控器、地面站和无线数字传输系统的一体化设备，可与 ArduPilot 配合使用。支持最远 15 "
"公里的高清视频、控制和数传传输，通过 SIYI HM30 中继模式可将距离翻倍。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:16 87953b44f58940cc8c76e0aeed328062
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:17 248b6873fb8e4d24a91974ff2d501bd0
msgid "Android based smart device with 7 inch 1080P screen."
msgstr "基于 Android 的智能设备，配备 7 英寸 1080P 屏幕。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:18 a2d7bf739c764e2e9c7fb4bccfb03667
msgid ""
"Integrated digital transmission system simultaneously transmitting video, "
"telemetry and control."
msgstr "集成数字传输系统，可同时传输视频、数传和控制信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:19 d487e1f555054105be5634d197c0bd5f
msgid ""
"SIYI Custom GCS Application or Mission Planner or QGC ground station "
"software with MAVLink support for ArduPilot and PX4."
msgstr ""
"SIYI 自定义 GCS 应用程序或 Mission Planner 或 QGC 地面站软件，支持 MAVLink，兼容 ArduPilot 和 "
"PX4。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:20 1f4f1d681631492581f7d17a2db517db
msgid "1080P HD video"
msgstr "1080P 高清视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:21 4241ebe9f9484b4b8b021626d78eb936
msgid "SBUS RC output plus 5 PWM channels on air unit"
msgstr "SBUS RC 输出及空中单元上 5 个 PWM 通道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:22 2c986c1c9afa460284c3b20c2818f13d
msgid "Ethernet camera input (HDMI converter provided)"
msgstr "以太网摄像头输入（附赠 HDMI 转换器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:23 ddb2be37beac44bdb46258de5b6640c6
msgid "Video recording"
msgstr "视频录制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:24 5ae1457c8a514f778140554ad07c0cdd
msgid "Dual operator capable"
msgstr "支持双操作手"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:25 0d3bc299d17e4faaa9f12db4a376a425
msgid "10 hour base unit battery life"
msgstr "地面单元电池续航 10 小时"

#: ../../source/docs/common-siyi-rc.rst:34 eb81292544ba4e6c80f67386c72a1b08
msgid ""
"More Info on SIYI systems can be found on `here <https://shop.siyi.biz/>`__"
msgstr "更多 SIYI 系统信息请访问 `此处 <https://shop.siyi.biz/>`__"
